  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[F]I'm in love [Cadd11/E]with the world\n[Dm]through the eyes [C]of a girl,\n[Bb]Who's still around [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.\n[F]We broke up [Cadd11/E]a month ago\n[Dm]and I grew up, [C]I didn't know,\n[Bb]I'd be around [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.\n\n[Solo]\n[F]  [Cadd11/E]\n[Dm]  [C]\n[Bb]  [F6/A]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]It's always been [Cadd11/E]wait and see\n[Dm]A happy day [C]and then you pay\n[Bb]And feel like shit [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.\n[F]But now I feel [Cadd11/E]changed around\n[Dm]and instead [C]falling down,\n[Bb]I'm standing up [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.\n\n[Chorus]\n[C][Bb]Situations get fucked up\n[Dm]and turned around [F]sooner or\n[G]la-\n[Bb/F]ter.\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F]I could be [Cadd11/E]another fool\n[Dm]or an [C]exception to the rule,\n[Bb]You tell me [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.\n\n[Chorus]\n[F]Crooked spin [Dbmaj7]can't come to rest,\n[Dm7]I'm [Ebsus2]damaged bad at best,\n[Dm7]She'll decide [F5/C]what she wants,\n[Bb]\n[F]I'll probably be [Dbmaj7]the last to know,\n[Dm7]No one [Ebsus2]says until it shows\n[Dm7]See [F5/C]how it\n[Gm]is, They\n[F6]want [F6add9]you or [Ebsus2]they\n[Dm]don't.. [Bbm]Say yes..\n\n[Verse 4]\n[F]I'm in love [Cadd11/E]with the world\n[Dm]through the eyes [C]of a girl,\n[Bb]Who's still around [F6/A]the morning\n[G]after.",
